      *************************************************************

       01  DATE-WS.
           05  DISPLAY-DATE          PIC X(5)    VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                PIC X(3)    VALUE SPACES.

       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           05  MSG-TEXT              PIC X(68)    VALUE SPACE.
           05  MSG-FLD               PIC X(8)     VALUE SPACE.
           05  MSG-FLD-9  REDEFINES  MSG-FLD      PIC ZZZZZZZ9.
           05  FILLER                PIC X(4).

       01  FIELD-NUMBER              PIC S9(4)    VALUE 1 BINARY.


       01 BCSF-REVIEW-MSG.
          05 FILLER                  PIC X  VALUE SPACES.
          05 BCSF-REVIEW-MSG-TEXT    PIC X(78).
      **   f2 - START THIS ITEM * f4- CONT THIS ITEM * f6 - PREV ITEMS *
      **   f7 - MORE ITEMS


       01  CSF-REVIEW-MSG.
           05  FILLER                PIC X(4) VALUE SPACES.
           05  CSF-REVIEW-MSG-TEXT   PIC X(75).
      **   ** PRESS:  f2 - START THIS ITEM * f4 - CONTINUE THIS ITEM *
      **   f7 - MORE ITEMS **


