           05  BC-REVIEW-MSG-TEXT    PIC X(64).
      **   ***  PRESS:  f4 - CONTINUE THIS ITEM ** f6 - PREV ITEMS ***


       01  CF-REVIEW-MSG.
           05  FILLER                PIC X(15) VALUE SPACES.
           05  CF-REVIEW-MSG-TEXT    PIC X(64).
      **   ***  PRESS:  f4 - CONTINUE THIS ITEM ** f7 - MORE ITEMS  ***


       01  C-REVIEW-MSG.
           05  FILLER                PIC X(24) VALUE SPACES.
           05  C-REVIEW-MSG-TEXT     PIC X(55).
      **   ***  PRESS:  f4 - CONTINUE THIS ITEM  ***


