       01  B-REVIEW-MSG.
           05  FILLER                 PIC X(28) VALUE SPACES.
           05  B-REVIEW-MSG-TEXT     PIC X(51).
      **   ***  PRESS:  f6 - PREV ITEMS  ***


       01  F-REVIEW-MSG.
           05  FILLER                PIC X(28) VALUE SPACES.
           05  F-REVIEW-MSG-TEXT     PIC X(51).
      **   ***  PRESS:  f7 - MORE ITEMS  ***


       01  NOT-FOUND-ITEM-MSG.
           05  FILLER                PIC X(18).
           05  NF-ITEM-NUMBER        PIC Z(4).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(57).
      **   ITEM NUMBER      ¢      ! DOES NOT EXIST - PRESS 'f8'
      **   TO TRY AGAIN **


       01  NOT-FOUND-CORPCODE-MSG.
           05  FILLER                PIC X(18).
           05  NF-CORPCODE           PIC X(8).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(55).
      **   CORPORATE CODE ¢       !  DOES NOT EXIST - PRESS 'f8'
      **   TO TRY AGAIN


       01  CAPACITY-EXCEEDED-MSG.
           05  FILLER                PIC X(25)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  CAPACITY-EXCEEDED-MSG-TEXT  PIC X(54).
      **   ***  ITEM TABLE CAPACITY EXCEEDED  ***


       COPY TDATECHK IN COPYLIB.

